{"product_id":"raptor-pack-step-into-reading-step-5","title":"Raptor Pack (Step-into-Reading, Step 5)","description":"\u003cp\u003ePaleontologist Robert T. Bakker tells the amazing story of a day in the life of a pack of Deinonychus(a.k.a.“raptor”) dinosaurs. Readers follow the creatures as they single out, kill, and devour an injured tenontosaur; climb up into a tree; fall asleep; and are themselves stalked by a giant predator. Includes an explanation of how scientists study rocks and minerals; fossil roots, claws, teeth, and bones; and modern predators to understand raptor behavior.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 229\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Dr Robert T. Bakker\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780375823039\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 48\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738270490777,"sku":"5RD9780375823039","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68cf94e6c7a16_Raptor_Pack__Step-into-Reading__Step_5__Dr_Robert_T._Bakker.jpg?v=1758560187","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/raptor-pack-step-into-reading-step-5","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}